<slide xmlns="https://www.larkoffice.com/sml/2.0">
  <style>
    <fill>
      <fillColor color="rgb(244,246,241)"/>
    </fill>
  </style>
  <data>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="36" width="840" height="24">
      <content textType="caption" fontSize="12" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(122,138,125,1)" letterSpacing="2" wrap="false">
        <p>03 · PLAN F · 历史口径重排</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="64" width="840" height="52">
      <content textType="headline" fontSize="30" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.25">
        <p>F · 先统一口径：重算历史攻击成功率</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="60" startY="124" endX="900" endY="124">
      <border color="rgba(42,45,48,0.2)" width="1"/>
    </line>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="144" width="420" height="30">
      <content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="18" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">
        <p>做了什么 · 怎么做</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="186" width="420" height="230">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77,90,83,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.55">
        <p><span bold="true">对象</span>：250 段历史攻击样本，全部重新核算分母与有效性口径</p>
        <p><span bold="true">固定预算</span>：每段固定生成 4 个候选，不做无上限搜索</p>
        <p><span bold="true">Valid Attack 定义</span>：通过质量门 且 检测分数低于阈值（2.33）才算有效</p>
        <p><span bold="true">补救臂</span>：对固定预算失败样本，再执行预先限定的自适应补救</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <line startX="500" startY="124" endX="500" endY="480" dashArray="dash">
      <border color="rgba(42,45,48,0.25)" width="1"/>
    </line>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="524" topLeftY="144" width="360" height="30">
      <content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="18" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">
        <p>结果</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="524" topLeftY="180" width="170" height="100">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="40" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(76,122,90,1)" textAlign="left" wrap="false">
        <p>191/250</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="524" topLeftY="284" width="170" height="44">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77,90,83,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35">
        <p>固定预算 Valid ASR<br/><span bold="true">76.4%</span></p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="716" topLeftY="180" width="170" height="100">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="40" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(76,122,90,1)" textAlign="left" wrap="false">
        <p>218/250</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="716" topLeftY="284" width="170" height="44">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77,90,83,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35">
        <p>补救后累计 Valid ASR<br/><span bold="true">87.2%</span></p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="524" topLeftY="340" width="360" height="120">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(110,120,114,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5">
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">249/250（99.6%）保留但降级</span>：只说明"检测分数存在大面积下降"，不再作为有效攻击率。</p>
        <p>同一批样本，换口径后数字从 99.6% 变为 76.4%——口径即结论。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="524" topLeftY="470" width="360" height="2">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgba(76,122,90,1)"/></fill>
    </shape>

    <line startX="60" startY="486" endX="900" endY="486">
      <border color="rgba(42,45,48,0.2)" width="1"/>
    </line>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="496" width="840" height="26">
      <content textType="caption" fontSize="12" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(122,138,125,1)">
        <p>来源：叙事.md Plan F；阈值 2.33 为当时固定检测阈值</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
  </data>
  <note>
    <content textType="body">
      <p>Plan F 不是新实验，而是把 250 段历史攻击重新按统一口径核算。</p>
      <p>每段固定四个候选，只有质量合格且分数低于阈值的才计为有效攻击，得到 191/250，约 76.4%。</p>
      <p>对固定预算失败的样本做预先限定的补救后，累计到 218/250，约 87.2%。</p>
      <p>原来的 99.6% 不再当作有效攻击率，只说明分数确实大面积下降。口径统一之后，才能进入独立确认阶段。</p>
    </content>
  </note>
</slide>
